backend search <TEXT> [--limit COUNT] [--cursor CURSOR]

Search exact keys, names, relations, and vectors together; every lane reports its coverage. Start here for a question like where error handling lives. Match names, signatures, and documentation, then open a coordinate.

operands
  TEXT            Text to find in names, signatures, and documentation.

options
  --limit         Maximum rows in this page, 1 to 200.
  --cursor        Opaque continuation returned by the preceding page; bound to its query and index snapshot.

